cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this tool, please cite both the VADER paper (Hutto & Gilbert, 2014) and this software."
title: "VADER-based Sentiment Analysis Tool"
abstract: >-
  A browser-based implementation of the VADER (Valence Aware Dictionary and
  sEntiment Reasoner) sentiment analysis algorithm. The analysis engine is a
  port of the reference Python implementation (vaderSentiment 3.3.2), verified
  against it by an automated test suite. Runs entirely in the browser and shows
  the rule adjustments applied to every word.
type: software
authors:
